OL,3,GNEWSADo not move care home residents,
OL,4,Asay campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have urged a council not to
OL,7,Fclose a care home or move its residents
OL,8,Fahead of a decision on its future.
OL,10,FWestmorland and Furness Council has
OL,11,Fspent most of 2026 considering whether
OL,12,Fto close Applethwaite Green care home
OL,13,Fin Windermere and Grisedale Croft in
OL,14,FAlston, and will make a decision in
OL,15,FDecember.
OL,17,FA report recommended closing
OL,18,FApplethwaite Green and moving residents
OL,19,Fto another home but said it should be
OL,20,Fdone in a "compassionate, proportionate
OL,21,Fand person-centred manner".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
