OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADo not move care home residents,
OL,4,Asay campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Nicholson, from the Applethwaite
OL,7,FGreen Community Group (AGCC), said the
OL,8,Fbuilding was a home for a "group of
OL,9,Felderly and vulnerable people" whose
OL,10,Fsense of security was "deeply
OL,11,Fconnected" to where they live.
